&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="listItem" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="134a5ed12c24" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Model and contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration across product management and the broader organization.&lt;/p&gt;
